# Docs after merge
File id only: `playbook-step-08-docs.mdc`. This is not a board column.

`Doc-` describes what works in `main`. The PR names the page, or says «вики не затронута», before merge. The wiki text is written after merge. Merge does not contain the wiki edit, and the wiki edit does not land before `main`.

- What works in `main` → `Doc-` pages. Decisions → `Doc-ADR-NNN-<Name>` (next free number).
- When the PR names a page: write that page before `статус: готово`. When the PR says «вики не затронута»: do not invent a page.
- Feature page: content mark «сделано» plus links (Doc-, ADR, PRs). The issue label remains the status. Epic: «сделано» only after owner acceptance (`playbook-step-07-acceptance.mdc`).
- Wiki push checks: `project-wiki.mdc`.
- After merge, read `TA: Doc- after merge` (`project-cursor-automations.mdc`). A gap comment is a checklist item, not the Doc- text itself: write the wiki page or fix the gap, then close the gap. Do not skip this procedure because the automation was silent, and do not duplicate a page that is already on the wiki.
